==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Rillaboom|15}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Captivating Rhythm''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Ludicolo|12}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*'''Drum Rush''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Rillaboom V|22}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

